{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01155","headline":"相和歌辞 猛虎行 · 储光羲","name":"相和歌辞 猛虎行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒亦不忧雪，饥亦不食人。\n人血岂不甘，所恶伤明神。\n太室爲我宅，孟门爲我邻。\n百兽爲我膳，五龙爲我宾。\n蒙马一何威，浮江亦以仁。\n彩章耀朝日，牙爪雄武臣。\n高云逐气浮，厚地随声振。\n君能贾余勇，日夕长相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}